            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio riire rigatuba Eema y’omosangererekano, na obonene bw’Omonene bogaichora ime ase Obomenyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa tanyara gosoa eema y’omosangererekano, ekiagera riire riria riabeete igoro yaye, na obonene bogaichora ime ase obomenyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero kende gionsi riire riare koimokerera igoro korwa ase obomenyo obwo, Abaisraeli nigo baare koimoka kogenda orogendo rwabo. Naboigo baare gokora ase orogendo rwabo rwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye riire tiriare koimokerera igoro, barabwo tibaare koimoka kogenda goika rituko riria riire riare koimokerera igoro naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki riire ri’Omonene nigo riare kobeera ase bomenyo ekero kia mobaso, na ekero kia botuko omorero oba ase riire ime; na agwo Abaisraeli bonsi baba bakorirora aande onsi ase barenge ase orogendo rwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.38"
            ]
          }
        }
